focus on class diagrams 

1. structure :-  name , attributes , operations
2. + : for public , - : private , # : protected , ~ : default
3. Relationship between classes 
      Composition  ---<> (color filled in) (here , child class can't exist independently of the parent class)
      Aggregation  ---<> the child can exist indenpdently of it's parent class (type of association)
      Association  -------  represents a bi-directional relationship between two classes.
                            it indicates that instances of one class are connected to instances of another class.
      Generalization  ------|> (inheritance) 

